# Workspace Facts

## Linear MCP Integration

`BLIZZ` is the Linear ticket prefix for this project (team: Blizz, org: grand-cluster-city).

2-way issue sync is enabled between Linear and GitHub. When referencing tickets in PR comments or other GitHub contexts, link to the GitHub issue (e.g. `#1`) rather than the Linear URL so the sync stays useful in both directions.

## About This Crate

`blizz` is a reusable Rust crate providing an animated terminal setup wizard for Kernelle Software CLI tools. It features a bobbing mascot, character-by-character decode text effects, and centered prompt primitives, all driven by an event-driven render loop via crossterm.

